{"id":"vod_md_3161","vodId":"3161","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵","name_cn":"食戟之灵","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/f8355ea7d5de7de3efb86eaff1d6e951.jpg"},"summary":"幸平创真（松冈祯丞 配音）出生于料理世家，其父经营着一间家庭餐馆，小小年纪的幸平即将父亲当做了榜样，发誓成为父亲那样的料理家。某一日，父亲找到了幸平，希望他能够进入顶级的料理学校“远月学园”深造磨练，背负着父亲的期许，幸平踏上了旅程。在学校里，幸平结识了名为薙切绘里奈（种田梨沙 配音）的少女，这位传说中拥有“神之舌”的傲娇少女，竟然将幸平所作的料理判定为“不合格”。外表热情开朗内心极有城府的一色慧（樱井孝宏 配音）、拥有孱弱身体和强大头脑的丸井善二（小林裕介 配音）、活泼开朗的吉野悠姬（内田真礼 配音），与这些“同行”交流着，竞争着，幸平还有很长的路要走。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-24 07:44:26","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/Z0JZqcch/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/gMGDm5Z1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/HJVvTKx2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/qmMeO2SI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/J9GaxUi1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/YTAGz7uu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/kLJvIj45/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/HADO3bGk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/KOpY2t3K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/BpaFW3dn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/q9lIyfhQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/wWEvABgA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/3HIrnisg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/geSLpD3Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230822/ceiJAOGN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","